 something：对某事的调查\n- under investigation：正在接受调查或正在被调查\n\nunder investigation 只表示调查尚未结束，并不等于已经证明当事人有罪或确实做错了事。"}]}, "individual": {"synonym": [{"pos": "n.", "trans": [{"word": "examination", "tran": "审查；考察"}, {"word": "enquiry", "tran": "调查"}]}], "anagram": {"wfs": [{"name": "名词复数", "value": "investigations"}], "word": "investigation"}, "idiomatic": [{"colloc": {"en": "a criminal/murder/police investigation", "zh": "刑事／凶案／警方调查"}}, {"colloc": {"en": "under investigation", "zh": "接受调查"}}, {"colloc": {"en": "investigation into sth.", "zh": "对某事的调查／研究"}, "sents": [{"en": "The police haven't completed their investigations into the accident.", "zh": "警察还未完成对这次事故的调查。"}, {"en": "He is conducting an investigation into the spending habits of teenagers.", "zh": "他正进行一项针对十几岁青少年的消费习惯的调查研究。"}]}], "trs": [{"pos": "n.", "tran": "侦察；调查"}], "level": "高考", "examInfo": {"year": 5, "questionTypeInfo": [{"time": 0, "type": "翻译"}, {"time": 0, "type": "知识运用"}, {"time": 0, "type": "写作"}, {"time": 0, "type": "听力理解"}, {"time": 0, "type": "阅读理解"}], "recommendationRate": 1, "frequency": 0}, "return-phrase": "investigation", "pastExamSents": [{"en": "We were carrying out the investigation.", "source": "2014·浙江卷", "zh": "我们正在展开调查。"}], "mnemonic": {"method": "investigate（调查）+ ion（表示名词）→ 调查", "word": "investigation"}, "derivative": [{"pos": "n.", "trans": [{"word": "investigator", "tran": "调查者"}]}, {"pos": "v.", "trans": [{"word": "investigate", "tran": "调查；研究"}]}, {"pos": "adj.", "trans": [{"word": "investigative", "tran": "调查研究的"}]}], "discriminate": {"word": "investigation", "content": "investigation，survey，research和inquiry都有“调查”的意思，但investigation一般指系统的调查以得到希望发现或需要知道的事，如\nThe police have started their investigations into this murder.\n警察开始对这个谋杀案进行调查。\nsurvey常指为写书面报告而进行的民意测验或调查，如\nThey conducted a survey of children under 10 in this city.\n他们对这个城市10岁以下的小孩进行了调查。\nresearch常指科学工作者为揭示自然规律或获取某个领域的新知识而进行长时间的调查研究，如\nThis team has carried out research into this field.\n这支队伍在此领域开展了调研。\ninquiry为普通常用词，指正式调查，也